ion%2Frow+boundary%2C+bind+the+selected+event%0Aregistry+to+its+production+headers+and+numerical+providers%2C+and+establish%0Aa+complete+common-volume+tariff.+Failure+remains+partial+exactly+as+in%0Athe+source%3B+no+rollback+or+automatic+failure+cleanup+is+added.%0A%0APrepared+for+%2A%2A%40CubeJerry%2A%2A+with+substantial+%2A%2AOpenAI+assistance%2A%2A.+Credit%0Athe+lifecycle%2C+exact%2Frounded+scalar+and+%236999+microcontrol+predecessors+and%0Athe+canonical+stream-model+authors.+This+is+model-assisted+research%2C%0Awithout+a+claim+of+independent+human+or+proof-kernel+acceptance.%0A",
